      "finding": "No conditional pivot branch met durability bar. Median net swing: CUT +0.36 (neg 9%), TRANSITION +0.26 (21%), PULL_UP +0.09 (33%), PNR +0.04 (45%), SPOT_UP +0.02 (40%), POST_UP -0.22 (77%), DRIVE -0.27 (88%). DRIVE/POST_UP negative net swing is durable across playoff units."
    },
    {
      "id": "FAM:SF-APPA-050",
      "status_as_recorded": "not a hypothesis test",
      "finding": "PUTBACK is top suppressor for 6+ stars (e.g. D. Mitchell d=-0.294 n_after=95; B. Beal d=-0.345 n=32; C. Holmgren d=-0.222 n=52). No multiplicity correction; n_after is 32-95 for PUTBACK vs thousands of baseline possessions."
